  "question": {
    "html": "<p>Three identical resistors each of resistance R are connected with a variable resistor X as shown. X is initially set to R. The current in the cell is 0.60 A.</p>\n<p>The cell has negligible internal resistance.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>X is now set to zero. What is the current in the cell?</p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\">0.45 A</li><li data-label=\"B\">0.60 A</li><li data-label=\"C\">0.90 A</li><li data-label=\"D\">1.80 A</li></ol>"
  },
